        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents A06-K0170, Solid Brass Rope Design Door Knocker</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Solid Brass 8 Inch English Rope Door Knocker With Urn Tipis is great for bigger doors. The traditional rope styling really brings out the highlights of all the finishes in which it is offered. It comes packaged with all the necessary mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBrass Accents provides distinctive craftsmanship with old-world tradition for a lifetime of elegance. Their products are hand finished in the USA. They are one of the world's leading crafters of cast-brass and hot-forged decorative brass hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Rope Design Door Knocker with Urn Tip:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Thickness: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
